                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "OK. Im about DONE trying these roller coaster experiences. i have a 980 ti, I7 hell, i got more then enough to handle every VR game out there but this one apparently! the framerate studders during the two outdoor coasters breaking the immersion anf frankly PISSING you off! the space one doesnt seem to be a good fit and the castle one is the shortest of them all! clocking in roughly around 2 MINS!\n\nDO NOT GET THIS GAME! i read the others reviews that made me happily purchase this and now im feeling like some people want VR so bad theyd accept ANYTHING!\n\n\n\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\nUPDATE.\n\ni will add this to be fair, the DEV has shown a couple of videos NOT having issues similiar to mine as far as framerate dips. this wouldve changed my overall opinion to this game just being light on substance if id experienced the same.\n\n maybe its the new NVIDIA drivers or something else? being that i can play raw data on epic and never experience framedrops im at a loss for a possible cause.",
